[{"client_msg_id":"2e236256-f750-42c5-9150-53fdfd679cb3","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"resolve.conf で取れる Windows 側のアドレスが 172.31.96.1 で、`$(hostname).\u003chttp://mshome.net|mshome.net\u003e` が 172.29.208.1、WSL2 の Linux のアドレスが 172.31.102.227 になってる。mshome . net はサブネットが異なるが、どういうアドレスなのだろう？","ts":"1626663345.468900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vmD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9364e13a-170b-4bfc-a0fd-9130fee6ead8","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"hostname コマンドは Linux 側の `/usr/bin/hostname` を使っても Windows 側の `hostname.exe` を使っても同じホスト名が返ってきてる。","ts":"1626663086.466500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"35D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"869bd255-bdb2-4d1b-bcd5-31c0d0726eec","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"`$(grep nameserver /etc/resolv.conf | awk '{print $2}')` が返すアドレスと `$(hostname).\u003chttp://mshome.net|mshome.net\u003e` が指すアドレスが違う。","ts":"1626662992.465200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T5w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f17f49dd-4f6b-408c-abad-c7498ee31b35","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"この方法試してみたけど上手くいかないなあ","ts":"1626662891.463900","thread_ts":"1626431770.454200","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ngo"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"048b2e4c-c850-44e5-9773-375e4e65c5e8","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"前、WindowsのWSL2でのX11表示が話題になったので\n\u003chttps://qiita.com/taichi-ishitani/items/b627e31a97fef24c6ee4\u003e\nなのかー","ts":"1626431770.454200","thread_ts":"1626431770.454200","attachments":[{"fallback":"Qiita: WSL2 での DISPLAY 設定 - Qiita","id":1,"title":"WSL2 での DISPLAY 設定 - Qiita","title_link":"https://qiita.com/taichi-ishitani/items/b627e31a97fef24c6ee4","text":"WSL2 での DISPLAY 設定 WSL2 では、\u003chttp://YOUR_HOSTNAME.mshome.net|Y